msgid "Symptoms: 'cat: /sys/block/nvme/removable' and 'Error looking up object for device /dev/nvme'. Update the big-mount package."
msgstr "Belirtiler: 'cat: /sys/block/nvme/removable' ve 'Error looking up object for device /dev/nvme'. big-mount paketini güncelleyin."

